<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - May 27.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - May 27.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    95/97    102/104     UNQ     186/187</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	   96/98    103/105   189/192   200/203</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - The Singapore bunker quotes were weak on Tuesday despite slightly improved enquiries, traders said. Some suppliers offered the 180-cst at as low as $96 per tonne, almost the same as the cargo levels. Traders said they expected bunker levels to remain depressed in the near term as supplies were healthy. -- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
</text>
